    "signature": "fn pushdown_limit_helper(pushdown_plan: std::sync::Arc<dyn ExecutionPlan>, global_state: GlobalRequirements) -> datafusion_common::error::Result<(datafusion_common::tree_node::Transformed<std::sync::Arc<dyn ExecutionPlan>>, GlobalRequirements)>",
    "docs": "This function is the main helper function of the `LimitPushDown` rule.\nThe helper takes an `ExecutionPlan` and a global (algorithm) state which is\nan instance of `GlobalRequirements` and modifies these parameters while\nchecking if the limits can be pushed down or not.\n\nIf a limit is encountered, a [`TreeNodeRecursion::Stop`] is returned. Otherwise,\nreturn a [`TreeNodeRecursion::Continue`].",
